# OxiDNS Plus prewarm watch list
# One entry per line:  domain [A|AAAA]
# - No qtype  -> both A and AAAA are scheduled
# - "domain A" -> only A; "domain AAAA" -> only AAAA
# Blank lines and lines starting with # are ignored.
#
# Put the hostnames you care about most here. Only these are prewarmed in
# mode=list (the default). To prewarm every cached domain instead, set
# option mode 'all' in /etc/config/oxidnsplus and this file is ignored.

# Examples (uncomment and edit):
# gateway.lan
# router.local A
# api.example.com AAAA
